      "filename": "Maharaja Fateh Singh of Udaipur, (r.1884-1930), on royal barge, Udaipur.jpg",
      "title": "File:Maharaja Fateh Singh of Udaipur, (r.1884-1930), on royal barge, Udaipur.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/Maharaja_Fateh_Singh_of_Udaipur%2C_%28r.1884-1930%29%2C_on_royal_barge%2C_Udaipur.jpg",
